{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Note:</strong> Requires the base game Abiotic Factor to access this content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reserved for the most dedicated of GATE researchers, the Supporter\u2019s Pack features a Home World, which is a base-building portal location and a home-away-from-home. The Supporter\u2019s Pack also contains the full standard uniform of all GATE Torii researchers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Home World Torii</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a well deserved vacation to the mysterious and scenic Torii, nestled among a forested Japanese mountainside and hiding a deeper secret within. This portal world is accessible from the GATE Cascade Research Facility\u2019s Office Sector (with Tier 1 keypad hacker access).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641780/extras/f6763d0aa31e0d6fc90e0e22c6114944.poster.avif?t=1753217775\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641780/extras/f6763d0aa31e0d6fc90e0e22c6114944.webm?t=1753217775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641780/extras/f6763d0aa31e0d6fc90e0e22c6114944.mp4?t=1753217775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Torii Uniform</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open Torii Jacket with M/F versions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Closed Torii Jacket with M/F versions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Torii Pants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Torii Belt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Torii Goggles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Torii ID Card</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Torii Boots</p></li><li><p 